    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Beyond Faded Voices, a narrative-driven indie sim where you play Zeus, my real cat, in a true based story of loss and love after my parents\u2019 deaths (dad first, then mom). Explore an old soviet building, old soviet snowy village, and surreal  dreamscapes in few hours.\u00a0 Face emotional challenges like balancing stealth and exploration, all backed by a melancholic  soundtrack. This genre-blending mix of cozy cat simulator, adventure, tower defenc, unrealistic moments from the Zeus's dreams and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Genre &amp; Style</u></strong>: Specified as a &quot;narrative-driven indie cat simulator&quot; with realistic graphic to highlight visual and gameplay styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mechanics</u></strong>: Detailed cat-specific actions (&quot;chase laser pointers,&quot; &quot;sneak with a bodycam,&quot; &quot;catch the rat&quot; etc.) to showcase unique gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong>: I wanted to showcase a few moments from the life of my cat Zeus and my parents. It\u2019s based on real events.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Beyond Faded Voices, a narrative-driven indie sim where you play Zeus, my real cat, in a true based story of loss and love after my parents\u2019 deaths (dad first, then mom). Explore an old soviet building, old soviet snowy village, and surreal  dreamscapes in few hours.\u00a0 Face emotional challenges like balancing stealth and exploration, all backed by a melancholic  soundtrack. This genre-blending mix of cozy cat simulator, adventure, tower defenc, unrealistic moments from the Zeus's dreams and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Genre &amp; Style</u></strong>: Specified as a &quot;narrative-driven indie cat simulator&quot; with realistic graphic to highlight visual and gameplay styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mechanics</u></strong>: Detailed cat-specific actions (&quot;chase laser pointers,&quot; &quot;sneak with a bodycam,&quot; &quot;catch the rat&quot; etc.) to showcase unique gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong>: I wanted to showcase a few moments from the life of my cat Zeus and my parents. It\u2019s based on real events.</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience moments in a third-person story about my passed away parents and my british cat Zeus. It's a mix of adventure, cat simulator and even Tower Defence and first person bodycam. Be the cat - sleep, sharp your claws, eat, be petted by parents and misbehave in a few hours!!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
